Errors (block the load):

Code	        Rule
----------------------------------------------------
E001	        Slug well-formed; gloss_en not empty
E002	        Part of speech is in the controlled list
E003	        Word has at least one dialect tag, and every tag is dhut, kham, or kaike
E004	        Every dialect tag has a form, and every form has a matching tag
E005	        No duplicate slugs
E006	        Only one form per dialect per word
E007	        form_script and form_romanized both present and NFC-normalized
E008	        Imported status is DRAFT
E009	        Source is in the permissions tracker with status signed, and has a license if the tracker has a license column
E010	        No withheld form is present
E011	        One romanization scheme per dialect
E012/E013	    Sample sign-off is incomplete, or a sampled form was rejected
